    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the forgotten sanctum of the Archmage Elara, a legendary spellcaster who vanished centuries ago. The chamber is lit by floating orbs of luminescent magic, casting long shadows across ancient artifacts and dusty tomes. A shimmering barrier blocks the only exit, humming with volatile arcane energy. According to the fading inscriptions on the walls, escaping this sanctum requires charting a safe path through the realm's magical leylines. To achieve this, you must awaken dormant magical relics, decipher arcane ciphers, and unlock the secrets bound within sealed objects of power. The magic in the air is heavy and unstable—one wrong move could trap you in this mystical labyrinth forever. You must carefully study the relics around you and discover how their powers intertwine to find your way out.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
